  "narration_lines": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "狼群封死退路，妹妹已无处可逃。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/m5_second_source/candidate_v1/narration_01.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.389,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "checksum": "sha256:5a50b0e3e9b5ddd8f5d32a6aabf24e37b01d18fd71d4a51bdb0e02dcf8962f39"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "几分钟前，她还被困在悬崖边。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/m5_second_source/candidate_v1/narration_02.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 4.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.304,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "checksum": "sha256:785f8ae2bbe147d21b8be4f3a28838b3787518a7bc68a3caefb1d4a8e192c439"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "兄妹刚脱险，就挖到五十年份的野山参。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/m5_second_source/candidate_v1/narration_03.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 8.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.731,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "checksum": "sha256:e41ee0289e958c3ae632335d164dd76b6aacc5b5123c1a03a4a06f26e3f98d4c"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "卖掉它，妹妹的大学学费就有了。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/m5_second_source/candidate_v1/narration_04.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 12.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.176,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "checksum": "sha256:2a0ffadd6c5e7b740fb37cbd8baff076be39b2fb5b71ecfdfe0bb6bcb5dcdf92"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "可狼群突然出现，再次把他们逼入绝境。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/m5_second_source/candidate_v1/narration_05.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 17.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "checksum": "sha256:206882c36d96c05642ca3825e137e121a35d61fbd83b660b1bd99c04beeed506"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "为护住妹妹，他第一次用山神之力驱兽。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/m5_second_source/candidate_v1/narration_06.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 21.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.603,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "checksum": "sha256:b8da69b1c04b8dc65863288dcb11e3c55b554e4b688935537b329c2393211011"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "群狼低头退去，他才明白，整座山都在回应自己。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/m5_second_source/candidate_v1/narration_07.wav",
